።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ጋዓንቴ ዒንሢ ዓሲ ሃይቃ ጎይሢ ሃይቃንዳኔ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ዎይሣ ሱኡጎ ጎይፆ ጉሪ ዒንሢ ሎኦማንዳኔ።»","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ፆኦሲዮ! ዔቄ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ሳዖ ዴሮ ዑፃ ቢያ ዎጌ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ዴራኣ ቢያ ኔኤሮኬ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/mdy_twf/PSA/82.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/mdy_twf/PSA/83.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/mdy_twf/PSA/81.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}